{
  "name": "API terjemahan sederhana (Webhook)",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## API terjemahan sederhana\nKirim teks, terima terjemahan. Cocok untuk deskripsi produk dwibahasa, Google Sheets, atau aplikasi lain.\n\n1. Buat credential **OpenAI** (Base URL penyedia + API key).\n2. Buat credential **Header Auth** untuk webhook: Name `X-Api-Key`, Value kata sandi buatanmu. Tanpa ini, siapa pun yang tahu URL-nya bisa memakai saldomu.\n3. Aktifkan workflow, lalu:\n\n```\ncurl -X POST https://n8n-kamu/webhook/terjemah \\\n  -H 'X-Api-Key: kata-sandi-kamu' \\\n  -H 'Content-Type: application/json' \\\n  -d '{\"teks\": \"Kopi susu gula aren\", \"ke\": \"English\"}'\n```",
        "height": 400,
        "width": 460
      },
      "id": "51e5659b-3ee5-5eee-b59a-c4e0f6bfa6e2",
      "name": "Catatan",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        -460,
        -260
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "httpMethod": "POST",
        "path": "terjemah",
        "authentication": "headerAuth",
        "responseMode": "responseNode",
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "6358fd52-b337-5c49-bd59-1c7b70b80624",
      "name": "Webhook terjemah",
